This isn't naming of individual items, it's naming of item classes.
Basically, the prompt spares you the effort of writing "scrolls named
QQWEWQ make my shirt glow" in your notebook, by marking all QQWEWQ
scrolls you'll find in the future (in that game) with whatever you
answered to the prompt.

